<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets $250 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets $250 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC and Paine Webber.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	SPREAD    +10 BP     MATURITY    30.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.872    FULL FEES   17.50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.872</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   7.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
